/span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3f/1/16/1f30d.png\" alt=\"🌍\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>4 Year&rsquo;s Unconditional Bachelor Degree Scholarship in &ldquo;NANTONG UNIVERSITY&rdquo;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Location: Nantong Univeristy, Nantong, Jiangsu (Near Shanghai)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Teaching: English Taught</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t25/1/16/1f393.png\" alt=\"🎓\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Major&rsquo;s:</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">1. International Economics &amp; Trade</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">2. Mechanical Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">3. Applied Statistics</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">4. Photoelectric Information &amp; Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">5. Pharmacy</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">6. Electronic Information Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">7. Computer Science &amp; Technology</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">8. Civil Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">9. Traffic Engineering</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">10. Artificial Intelligence</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">11. Intelligent Manufacturing</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">12. Electric Engineering &amp; Automation</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">13. Automation</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">14. Accounting</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> কেন চায়নাতে পড়বেন?</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ সরকারি বিশ্বমানের বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ে ফুল স্কলারশীপ নিয়ে পড়াশুনা।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ ওয়ার্ল্ড র&zwnj;্যাঙ্কিং- এ ৫০০-১০০০ মধ্যে ইউনিভার্সিটি।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ ইংরেজী মাধ্যমে পড়াশুনা এবংবিশ্বমানের ল্যাব।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ Vacation- এ শিক্ষার্থীরা সহজেই দেশে আসা যাওয়া করতে পারে।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ পর্যাপ্ত নিরাপত্তা সম্বলিত ক্যাম্পাস যেখানে সকল বাংলাদেশি খাবার সহজলভ্য।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ সুবিশাল ক্যাম্পাসে পড়াশুনার পাশাপাশি খেলাধুলা, জিমন্যাসিয়াম, স্পোর্টস গ্রাউন্ড (ইনডোর ও আউটডোর), সুইমিংপুল, চিত্ত বিনোদন, কালচারাল প্র্যাকটিস, স্ট্যাডি ট্যুর সহ সকল আধুনিক সুবিধা বিদ্যমান।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">⮞ বিশ্বের প্রায় ৭৫টি দেশের শিক্ষার্থীদের সাথে একসাথে অধ্যয়ন।</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6a/1/16/1f530.png\" alt=\"🔰\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>Contact us for more details<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6a/1/16/1f530.png\" alt=\"🔰\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Contact Number:</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">+88-1768820865 (BD)</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">+88-1811256545 (BD)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"📍\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> LOCATION</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tropical Tower(5th floor),Bata Signal, Elephant Road, Dhaka-1205</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">WhatsApp. <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1fey0fg\" style=\"cursor: pointer; text-decoration-line: none; margin: 0px; text-align: inherit; padding: 0px; outline: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; touch-action: manipulation; background-color: transparent; display: inline; font-family: inherit; border: 0px initial initial;\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://wa.me/message/SEE5UHEBZMKUO1?fbclid=IwAR0bG0rP9cnVREGkce3U4kV99LcNn8Agtu-HjQk8cVyGWBc4A8iYE5W6bdM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://wa.me/message/SEE5UHEBZMKUO1</a></span></div>\r\n</div>', 'Congratulations to  Sk Aaron Sakib', 'congratulations-to-sk-aaron-sakib', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'success-story', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/24_1680219079.jpg', '2023-03-30 23:31:19', '2023-03-30 23:31:19', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(25, 1, '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xdj266r x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">GOOD LUCK DEAR Rafi (RAFI AHMAD)<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8c/1/16/1f389.png\" alt=\"🎉\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">সে চীনের বিখ্যাত HARBIN INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY তে COMPUTER ENGINEERING FULL FREE স্কলারশিপের মাসিক (STIPEND) উপবৃত্তি সহকারে এডমিশন সম্পন্ন করেছে l</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">QS WORLD RANK -217 <span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t50/1/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">US NEWS WORLD RANK -196<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t50/1/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tc/1/16/1f449_1f3fb.png\" alt=\"👉🏻\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>চায়নার টপ দশটি ইউনিভার্সিটির মধ্যে Harbin Institute of Technology একটি অন্যতম পাবলিক ইউনিভার্সিটি যারা কিনা প্রথম চাঁদের <span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f313.png\" alt=\"🌓\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> কক্ষপথে স্যাটেলাইট <span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t58/1/16/1f6f0.png\" alt=\"🛰️\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> পাঠাতে সক্ষম হয়েছিল&hellip;.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&ldquo;cradle of engineers,\" হিসাবে বিখ্যাত, হারবিন ইনস্টিটিউট অফ টেকনোলজি (HIT) হল চীনের আইভি লিগ (C9 লীগ) বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ের সদস্য , 100 বছরেরও বেশি সময় ধরে যার বিজ্ঞান ও প্রকৌশল এ সর্বোচ্চ<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t50/1/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>। HIT এর তিনটি ক্যাম্পাসের মধ্যে অন্যতম Shenzhen campus-একটি শক্তিশালী আন্তর্জাতিক পরিবেশ গড়ে তুলেছে। সেনজেন এটি হংকং শহরের সাথে অবস্থিত এবং এই শহরটি চায়নার সবচাইতে উন্নত শহর গুলির মধ্যে একটি যেখান থেকে পুরো পৃথিবীর 90 % ইলেকট্রনিক্স পণ্য উৎপাদন করা হয় এবং পৃথিবীর সবচেয়ে বড় বড় কোম্পানিগুলো প্রধান দপ্তর এই শহরে অবস্থিত<span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t50/1/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">We wish him all the best for this achievement <span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"width: 16px; display: inline-flex; margin: 0px 1px; height: 16px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: inherit;\"><img style=\"border: 0px;\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t68/1/16/1f495.png\" alt=\"💕\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"ma