(33, 1, '<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\"From my point of view, AR-Education is the best mentor for China. They are very good and friendly. Highly recommended those who want to study in China with good opportunity.\"</p>', 'Minhajul Islam', 'sadiya-rose', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'testimonial', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/33_1680418871.jpg', '2023-03-31 00:02:59', '2023-04-02 17:01:11', NULL, 1),
