ical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✍ Requirements:</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Passport&rsquo;s 5 Pages&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Digital Picture (White Background)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Academic Certificates &amp; Transcripts</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">4.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Physical Examination Report&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">5.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;English Language Proficiency</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">6.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Police Clearance</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">7.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Bank Statement</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">8.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Study Plan</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">9.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;CV</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0cm; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: times new roman;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Contact us for more details</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 5px auto; padding: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-indent: 0em; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 'NANTONG UNIVERSITY', 'nantong-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/44_1690110149.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:13:11', '2023-10-10 15:56:13', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(45, 3, '<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">Nanjing Medical University is an institution of higher learning with a glorious history and excellent traditions. As early as 1941, it became one of the first institutions in China to admit graduate students. It was also one of the first medical colleges in China to offer six-year medical education programs, and one of the first to be authorized to confer doctoral and master\'s degrees in China, as well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">Today the university is a modern medical education institution with a complete range of disciplines, a strong faculty, and first class research capacities. It has seven first-level discipline doctoral programs, eleven first-level discipline master\'s programs, and six postdoctoral research centers. Its degree programs cover seven disciplines &ndash; medicine, science, technology, management, law, education, and literature. The university has three state-level key disciplines and one key discipline for state-level cultivation. It also has one academician from the Chinese Academy of Engineering and one state key laboratory.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">In the past eight decades, the university has cultivated a great number of medical and health care talents and made an enduring contribution to the health cause of humankind.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', tahoma, arial, 宋体; font-size: 13px; background-color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">In the new century, the university aims to become one of the highest grade medical universities, with distinctive features and international fame; and it will strive to make even more outstanding contributions in medical education, research, service, and culture.</p>', 'Nanjing Medical University', 'nanjing-medical-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/45_1690109890.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:20:27', '2023-07-23 20:58:10', NULL, 1),
(46, 3, '<h4 style=\"margin: 48.875px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'Microsoft YaHei\', iconfont; font-weight: 400; transition: all 0.5s ease 0s; color: #4b4b4b; text-align: justify;\">Located in the historic city of Xi\'an, cradle of Chinese civilization and terminus of the ancient Silk Road, Northwestern Polytechnical University (NPU) is the only multidisciplinary and research-oriented in China that is simultaneously developing education and research programs in the fields of aeronautics, astronautics, and marine technology engineering. It is now affiliated to the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT). Since the establishment of the People\'s Republic of China (PRC), NPU has always been one of the nation&rsquo;s key universities. In 1960 it was approved as a state key university by the State Council. It ranked among China&rsquo;s top 15 universities in the state&rsquo;s 7th and 8th Five-Year plans; and NPU is one of the first 22 universities to have established a graduate school. It was one of the first universities to enter into the 211 Project in 1995 and the 985 Project in 2001. NPU is a member of the \"Outstanding University Alliance\" program and is honored as a National Role Model Unit, a National Pioneer for Optimal Advanced Basic-level Party Organization and a Model University for Graduate Employment etc. NPU adheres to the motto \" Loyalty，Integrity，Courage and Perseverance\" while carrying forward the spirit of \" Strong Preparation，Diligent Effort，Practical Attitude，and Creative Innovation\". NPU has put its roots down in the west; dedicated itself to national defense and written several &ldquo;firsts&rdquo; into the history of the PRC. Now NPU will continue to pioneer new pathways into the future in the process of building a world first-class university and world first-class disciplines.</h4>', 'Northwestern Polytechnical University', 'northwestern-polytechnical-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/46_1690109707.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:30:25', '2023-07-23 20:55:07', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(47, 3, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">HISTORY AND&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">STATUS QUO</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Nanjing University of Information Science &amp; Technology (NUIST), founded in 1960 and renamed from Nanjing Institute of Meteorology in 2004, was designated as one of the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">national&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">key institutions of higher&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">education</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;in 1978. NUIST is co-constructed by the Jiangsu Provincial People&rsquo;s Government,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">China Meteorological Administration (CMA)</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, the State Oceanic Administration&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">(</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">SOA</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">)</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">and&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">the Ministry of Education.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">In 2017, NUIST</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;is on the list of China&rsquo;s &ldquo;Double First-class&rdquo; construction universities and disciplines as well as Jiangsu high level universities.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">In recent years, NUIST\'s comprehensive ranking in the international mainstream university rankings has risen rapidly.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">In 202</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">2</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">, it ranked&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">around</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">&nbsp;5</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">0</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">th among&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">Chinese mainland</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">&nbsp;universities&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">and 900</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">th</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">among world universities&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px; text-indent: 37px;\">in the four major global university rankings of Times, U.S. News, ARWU, and QS.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-indent: 36px; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">ADVANTAGEOUS DISCIPLINES</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">NUIST has a complete higher education system with undergraduate, postgraduate, doctoral program</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">me</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">s as well as post-doctoral research centres. The&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">eight</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;disciplines of Geoscience, Engineering, Computer Science</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;Environmental Science &amp; Ecology</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, Chemistry, Agricultural Science,Materials Science and Social Science&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">have entered top 1% ESI</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">rankings</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, among which&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Geoscience</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">and&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Computer Science</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">have entered top 1</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">&permil;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">. The&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">discipline</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Atmospheric Science</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;ranks</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">No.1</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">the discipline evaluation conducted by the Ministry of Education of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">China and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">6</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">th in the world&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">according to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">ShanghaiRanking\'s Global Ranking of Academic Subjects</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-indent: 37px; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">S</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">TUDENTS AND FACULTY</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Currently, NUIST has&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">about 35800 full-time students, including 28</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">,</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">3</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">00 undergraduate</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">students</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">6</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">2</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">00 postgraduate students</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">and</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">1,</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">3</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">00 international students</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">There are</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">more than</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">2</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">0</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">00</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;full-time&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">faculty members</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, with&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;more than&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">120</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">high-end scholar</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">s including academicians of Chinese, EU, French</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Russian</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Academies of Sciences,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">MOE Special Professors</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">and</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;National Distinguished Young Scholars.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">8</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">5</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">% of the full-time teachers have doctor</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">ate</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">s and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">6</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">7</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">% of them have experiences of studying or working abroad</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">for no less than one year</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-indent: 37px; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">I</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">NTERNATIONAL COOPERATION</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">NUIST has established cooperative relationship with&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">over&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">100</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;overseas universities and colleges from</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">over 30&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">countries</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">and regions</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;including Yale University,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Harvard University</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">, the University of Reading, the University of Manchester,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">South East Technological University,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Carlton University</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">,</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Delft University of Technology, Macquarie University and Monash University</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">. NUIST was admitted to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">such&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">programmes&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">as&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Chinese Government Scholarship, the Confucius Institute Scholarship and Jiangsu Government Scholarship. To date, the WMO Regional Training Centre Nanjing at NUIST has trained over&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">4,</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">3</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">00</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;senior meteorological and hydrological&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">professionals&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">for&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">15</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">8&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">countries and regions and become the world&rsquo;s largest training centre&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">of</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-indent: 37px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;top quality.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Diversified cooperation modes with worldwide first-class universities is a characteristic of NUIST</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">&rsquo;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">s international cooperation, among which t</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">o establish joint&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">research institutes is t</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">he most&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">effective one</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Typical examples include the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">NUIST-</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Harvard J</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">oint&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">L</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">aboratory for Air Quality and Climate</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">(JLAQC) and&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Yale</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">-&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">NUIST Atmospheric Environment&nbsp; Research Centre</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">. &nbsp;JLAQC</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">has gained a large number of creative scientific achievements. In recent 3 years, 12 papers from the JLAQC research fellows were published in top international academic journals such as&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Nature Climate Change</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,&nbsp;</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Nature Geoscience</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,&nbsp;</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Nature Communications</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,&nbsp;</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">PNAS</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">,&nbsp;</span></em></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Advanced Materials</span></em></strong><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">.&nbsp;</span></em><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">The cooperation with Yale University was reported as a model of Sino-US scientific research cooperation &nbsp;in the article titled&nbsp;</span><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-decoration-line: underline; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Science superpowers find common ground</span></em><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">by&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Nature</span></em></strong><em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">.&nbsp;</span></span></em><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Besides joint&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">l</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">aboratory</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">(research center), there are many other cooperation methods like applying for joint scientific research programmes, jointly cultivating PHD students and postdoctors, and co-hosting international conferences,workshops or seminars. &nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Another successful cooperative mode is&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">transnational&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">education</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">institutions and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">programme</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">s</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">, such as NUIST Reading Academy co-constructed with the University of Reading and NUIST Waterford Institute co-constructed with the &nbsp;South East Technological University.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Moreover, there are various short-term students</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">&rsquo;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">or teachers</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">&rsquo;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">exchanging programmes between NUIST and our global partners.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">International Association of Meteorological Education&nbsp;and&nbsp;Sciences</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">(IAMES)</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Environmental pollution and meteorological disasters have become common challenges faced by mankind. The International Association of Meteorological Education&nbsp;and&nbsp;Sciences (IAMES) was established in December 2020,&nbsp;which was initiated&nbsp;by NUIST&nbsp;and supported&nbsp;by more than 30 colleges, universities and scientific research institutions from over 20 countries.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">IAMES is a non-governmental, non-profit, academic and scientific organization, dedicated to international promotion and coordination of scientific studies and education on meteorology (atmospheric science, hydrology, environmental science and other meteorology related disciplines). IAMES encourages the application of this knowledge to social needs, such as weather forecast, climate change, mitigation of natural hazards and environmental preservation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">IAMES is established to stimulate meteorological education and research, promote scientific and technological innovation, share high-quality platform resources, provide government policy consultation, and enhance the coordination ability to respond to major scientific issues.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">There are 34 members&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">in</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;IMAES, such as NUIST, Nanjing University, Sun Yat-sen University, Princeton University, the University of Reading, Russian State Hydrometeorological University, Seoul National University and Cairo University.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">The establishment of IAMES got strong support from Chinese government (e.g.</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">Ministry of Education, Ministry of Science and Technology, Ministry of Commerce, China Meteorological Administration) and international organizations such as World Meteorological Organization (WMO). Petteri Taalas, Secretary-General of WMO, sent a video in April, 2021 to show his support on behalf of WMO to congratulate the establishment of IAMES.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: calibri; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">College of International Students</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">(CIS)</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">NUIST started to enroll international students &nbsp;in 1990 and the international degree programmes were approved in 1996. The College of International Students undertakes admission, teaching and administration of international students studying in a variety of programmes including Chinese language&nbsp;and other&nbsp;bachelor&rsquo;s, master&rsquo;s and doctoral programmes taught in Chinese and English.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">The number of international students reached 1700+ from over 120 countries, 82% of whom&nbsp;are degree students, and 29% of whom&nbsp;are postgraduates.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: calibri; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">WMO Regional Training Center</span></strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Nanjing (WMO RTC Nanjing)</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #333333; text-align: justify; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">The World Meteorological Organization Regional Training Centre Nanjing&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">(</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">WMO</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">RTC</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">Nanjing)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">is located at NUIST. Approved by the Executive Council of WMO, the RTC Nanjing was established in 1993. It has held&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">about 200</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;international and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">dozens of</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;bilateral training courses&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">since</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;1990. Nearly 4,000 meteorologists and hydrologists from 157 countries (regions) have&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">been trained</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;at NUIST; many of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">the trainees</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;have&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 19px; font-family: \'times new roman\';\">been</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-size: 19px;\"> the backbones of their National Meteorological and Hydrological Services (NMHSs).</span></p>', 'Nanjing University of Information Science & Technology', 'nanjing-university-of-information-science-technology', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/47_1690109469.jpg', '2023-05-20 17:33:09', '2023-07-23 20:51:09', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(48, 1, '<p><span style=\"background-color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>Overview of Southwest Petroleum University;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Southwest Petroleum University (SWPU), the second petroleum university in the People\'s Republic of China, was founded in 1958, andis now administered and supported by Chinese central government and Sichuan province local government, with the latter playing a biggerrole. SWPU has 16 schools, 1 Photo voltaic Industry and Technology Research Institute, 1 Institute of New Energy and UnconventionalOil and Gas, and 1 engineering training center. There are 8 subjectgroups: science, engineering, management, economics, arts, law, education and artistics. 68 programs under those subject groups are qualified to recruit undergraduates; 5 first-levelprograms and 24 second-level programs are authorized to offer doctoral degrees. 20 first-level programs and 86 second-level programsare authorized to offer master&rsquo;s degrees. Thereare 4 postdoctoral research stations, 1 first-level program and 3 second-level programs, which are all recognized as national key programs. This university contains2 state-level teachers&rsquo; teams, 3 state-level experimental teaching demonstration centers, 2 state-level experimental teaching centers of virtual simulation,and 3 innovators&rsquo; teams supported by &ldquo;Program for Changjiang Scholars and Innovative Research Team in University&rdquo; of China&rsquo;s Ministry of Education. This university has a staff of 2,506,of whom 261 are full professors, senior engineers and other senior professionals, and 574 are associate professors, associate senior engineers and other associate senior professionals. There are 1,630 full-time teachers, including 1 Chinese Academy of Engineering academicians, 2 State Council Academic Degrees Committee members, 2 &ldquo;National Science Fund for DistinguishedYoung Scholars&rdquo; receivers, 2 Distinguished &ldquo;Changjiang Scholars Program&rdquo; Professors, 1 &ldquo;Sichuan Spire Talents Training Project&rdquo;candidates, and 9 &ldquo;New Century Hundred-Thousand-Ten Thousand Talents Project&rdquo; candidates. SWPU has 111 scientific research bases on all levels,which have undertaken 2,679 government research projects and 3,757 petroleum industry sponsored research projects since the initiation of China&rsquo;s 12th Five-YearPlan. SWPU has been awarded the grand prize and first prize of &ldquo;NationalScience and Technology Progress&rdquo; and the second prize of &ldquo;National Science and Technology Progress and Invention&rdquo;, totaling 133 times; the university has been awarded state-level teaching achievement prizes and ministerial-level teaching achievement prizes, the former amountingto 8 times while the latter 84 times. For academic exchanges and research collaboration, SWPU has established close ties with universities and academic research institutionsin the United States, Russia, Britain, Germany, Japan, France, Canada, etc. SWPU has two campuses, one in Chengdu and the other in Nanchong,covering an area of over 200 ha. The current student body on the two campuses includes29,367 undergraduates, 4,037 graduates, 700 PhD candidates and 301 international students. So far SWPU has produced more than 146,000 bachelors, masters and doctors, many of whom havee stablished themselves as preeminent specialists and scholars, great statesmen,successful entrepreneurs, or technological and managerial backbones in various fields. In the spirit of &ldquo;fuel up our country and gas up our nation&rdquo;, and in keeping with the motto of &ldquo;righteous deed, persistent quest,extensive learning and creative mind&rdquo;, SWPU has formulated a &ldquo;second-time pioneering strategy&rdquo; to achieve the goals of becoming a first-class university in China and getting the leading-edge programs recognized worldwide before celebrating her 100thanniversary.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>Offer:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Bachelor Degree Scholarship for September Intake, 2024 &ldquo;Southwest Petroleum University&rdquo;</p>\r\n<p>Teaching Language: English</p>\r\n<p>Location: Sichuan, China&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Tuition: Free</p>\r\n<p>Hostel: 1600 RMB/Year (for boys), 3000 RMB/Year (for girls)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Major&rsquo;s:</p>\r\n<p>1. Computer Science &amp; Technology</p>\r\n<p>2. International Economics &amp; Trade</p>\r\n<p>3. Petroleum Engineering</p>\r\n<p>4. Civil Engineering</p>\r\n<p>5. Resource Exploration Engineering</p>\r\n<p>6. Chemical Engineering &amp; Technology</p>\r\n<p>7. Mechanical Engineering</p>\r\n<p>8. Electrical Engineering &amp; Automation</p>\r\n<p>9. New Energy Science and Engineering</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Requirement&rsquo;s:</p>\r\n<p>1.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Passport</p>\r\n<p>2.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Picture</p>\r\n<p>3.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>High School Certificate &amp; Transcript</p>\r\n<p>4.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>English Language Proficiency</p>\r\n<p>5.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Police Clearance</p>\r\n<p>6.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Bank Statement</p>\r\n<p>7.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Study Plan</p>\r\n<p>8.<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Recommendation Letter from High School&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Contact us for more details</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Southwest Petroleum University', 'welcome-to-southwest-petroleum-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/48_1690109297.jpg', '2023-05-20 19:48:13', '2023-10-10 16:18:19', NULL, 1),
(49, 3, '<div class=\"col_news_head\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: u5b8bu4f53, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; color: #333333;\">\r\n<ul class=\"col_metas clearfix\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: none;\">\r\n<li class=\"col_title\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 30px; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: inline-block; float: left; height: 30px; background-position: 0px bottom; background-color: #274372;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 50px 0px 25px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: inline-block; color: #ffffff; text-align: justify;\">Brief Introduction to the University</h2>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"col_path\" style=\"margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 18px; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: inline-block; float: right; white-space: nowrap; height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col_news_con\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: u5b8bu4f53, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: #333333;\">\r\n<div class=\"col_news_list\" style=\"margin: 7px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n<div id=\"wp_column_article\" class=\"wp_single wp_column_article\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n<div class=\"wp_entry\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; width: 728px; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n<div class=\"wp_articlecontent\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n<div id=\"wp_content_w6_0\" class=\"paging_content\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Anhui Medical University is a provincial key university jointly built by Anhui Provincial Government, the National Health and Family Planning Commission and the Ministry of Education.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;Its predecessor is Private Southeast Medical University founded in Shanghai in 1926. In 1930, it changed the name into Southeast Medical College. At the end of 1949, it moved to Huaiyuan</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Anhui Province and became the first higher medical education institution in Anhui Province. In 1952, it was relocated in Hefei and changed its name to Anhui Medical College. In 1985, its name was finally changed into Anhui Medical University.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: white; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The University adopts the inscriptions of&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&ldquo;Learning and practicing, training competent doctors.&rdquo;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">as its motto, which is written by Mr. Cai Yuanpei, a well-known educator, carries forward the glorious tradition of &ldquo;devotion to the country and the people; dedication to human health&rdquo;, adheres to the educational philosophy of &ldquo;national rejuvenation</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">devotion; benevolence&rdquo;, advocates the academic principles of &ldquo;Truthfulness; refinement; innovation&rdquo;, and is committed to building a high-level medical university.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The University currently has four main campus areas---the campus of Meishan Road Area, the campus of Feicui Road Area, the east campus (under construction), and the campus of Chaohu School of Clinical Medicine, covering an area of 1820 mu in total. The University consists of 16 directly-affiliated teaching institutions and has 6 directly-affiliated hospitals (the First Affiliated Hospital, the Second Affiliated Hospital, the Fourth Affiliated Hospital, Affiliated Chaohu Hospital, Affiliated Fuyang Hospital and Stomatological Hospital of Anhui Province).</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;In the University, there are 11,486 full-time regular undergraduates, 3,813 full-time graduates, 407 international students, and 17,721 adult students of university or junior college level (amateur). The University has a staff of 9,614 people, including 1,207 in-service faculty members at the university headquarters (the campus of Meishan Road Area). There are 670 full-time teachers in the University, among whom 91% have doctorate or master&rsquo;s degree.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The University has focus on medicine, with a coordinated development of science, engineering, management, law and other disciplines. There are 30 undergraduate majors including clinical medicine (&ldquo;5+3&rdquo; integration). There are 2 authorized Level-I disciplinary centers of doctoral degree in clinical medicine and pharmacy, 26 authorized Level-II disciplinary centers, 10 authorized Level-I disciplinary centers of master&rsquo;s degree, 59 authorized Level-II disciplinary centers of master&rsquo;s degree; and 1 professional doctorate degree granting right and 8 professional master&rsquo;s degrees granting rights. Clinical Medicine together with Pharmacology and Toxicology enters the top 1% of ESI global ranking.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">AHMU has established three post-doctoral research centers, Namely&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">pharmacology,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">clinical medicine and public health and preventive medicine. The University has national key disciplines such as Dermatology and Venereology; 14 national key clinical specialties; 3 provincial discipline construction Major program; 18 provincial key discipline; 2 Key Laboratories of Ministry of Education; 1 National Key Laboratory Base co-invested by Anhui Province and Ministry of Science and Technology; 25 provincial and ministerial level laboratories; National Drugs Clinical Research Base</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1 Science and Technology Innovation Team of Ministry of Education; 2 Science and Technology Innovation Team of Anhui Province; 3 Industrial Innovation Team of Anhui &ldquo;115&rdquo;; 3 Science and Research Innovation Team of Colleges and Universities at Anhui Province; 1 Think Tank of Anhui Province.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Being among &ldquo; National Foundational Capability Promotion Project of colleges and universities in the central and western regions&rdquo;, AHMU has carried out National Undergraduate Innovation and Entrepreneurship Training Program. The university has 4&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">national level specialities at colleges and universities; 2 national level&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">pilot programs on&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">speciality comprehensive reform; 2 national level &ldquo;Preeminent Doctor&rdquo; education and training programs; 1 national level teaching team; 2 National Excellent Courses; 2 National Excellent resources -sharing Courses; 2 National Experimental Teaching Demonstration Center; 1 National virtual simulation Experimental Teaching Center; 1 national&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&ldquo;famous teacher in the program of 10 thousand teachers&rdquo;; 1 course being elected as &ldquo;Famous Brand Course taught in English&rdquo; for international students studying in China by Ministry of Education and 1 Second prize in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">Teaching Quality Project&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">on national level.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">There are Over 30 teachers winning the titles including &ldquo;Changjiang Scholar appointed by Ministry of Education&rdquo;,&ldquo;Young Scholar appointed by Ministry of Education&rdquo; and &ldquo;the New Century Talents Project &rdquo;;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">24 teachers taking position in international academic organizations &amp; SCI source journals; 5 teachers taking position as chief editor for standardized textbooks in the &ldquo;11th &amp; 12th five-year plan&rdquo;; 4 teachers taking position as the chief commissioner of National Speciality Society; 1 teacher taking position as the Chairperson of Asian Academic Organization; 9 teachers chosen as experts on the advisory board of university medical and pharmaceutical disciplines of the Ministry of Education, over 10 teachers winning titles such as national and provincial model teacher, outstanding teacher.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The number of National Natural Sciences Foundation Projects maintains the leading position among colleges and universities in Anhui Province for consecutive years. Research results were listed in the Top 10 National Scientific Development in 2010 and 2014 and the Top 10 National Scientific and Technological Development among Chinese universities in 2012. The University has won one second prize in National Award for Science and Technology Progress, one first prize in Higher Education Institutes Scientific Research Award for Outstanding Achievements, two China Science Awards for Young Scientists , and four first prizes in Chinese Medical Science and Technology Awards. Large amounts of high quality SCI papers were published on world famous academic journals such as&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Cell</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;,the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">New England Journal of Medicine</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Nature Genetics</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The university edits and publishes across the country 14 kinds of academic journals such as&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Journal of Anhui Medical University</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Chinese Journal of Pharmacology</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Chinese Journal of Clinical and Experimental Pathology</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Chinese Journal of Disease Control</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">. The university library is the Anhui Provincial central library with sharing network for national biomedical literature resources. It is the branch center of medicine of Anhui Academy Digital Library and the searching workstation for the Ministry of Education. &nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">AHMU has adhered to the policy of Openness, Cooperation and Win-win, and has established strategic partnerships with Academy of Military Medical Sciences, Tsinghua University, Hefei Institute of Physical Science, Chinese Academy of Sciences, University of Hong Kong, etc. and operates more than 50 clinical schools in hospitals and over 60 professional practice and teaching bases, throughout cities in Anhui Province, Beijing, Shanghai, Jiangsu Province, Shandong Province, Zhejiang Province, Guangdong Province, Fujian Province and Xinjiang.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5em; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 37px; background: #e3e3e3 !important; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: \'times new roman\'; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The university has established extensive cooperation and communication with universities in Germany, Australia, America, United Kingdom, Spain, Sweden , Canada, Japan, Korea, Taiwan and Hong Kong District,etc. Both sides have exchanged experts, scholars, students, information and have cooperated in talent training and scientific researches. (Updated in May, 2017)</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Anhui Medical University', 'anhui-medical-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/49_1684841586.jpg', '2023-05-23 21:33:06', '2023-05-23 21:33:06', NULL, 1),
(50, 3, '<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.4rem; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; line-height: 1.2em; font-weight: normal; font-size: 0.99rem; color: #074f9e; font-family: fru, -apple-system, \'PingFang SC\', BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Open Sans\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">Introduction</h2>\r\n<div class=\"ge-cont\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; color: #333333; font-family: fru, -apple-system, \'PingFang SC\', BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Open Sans\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; text-align: justify; font-size: 0.2rem; color: #222222; line-height: 0.4rem;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div id=\"vsb_content_4_2083_u141\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<div id=\"vsb_content_4\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word;\">\r\n<p class=\"vsbcontent_start\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; text-indent: 2em; text-align: justify; font-size: 14pt; color: #222222; line-height: 33.6px;\">Harbin Engineering University (HEU) dates back to the PLA Military Engineering Institute founded in 1953. In 1970 its name changed to Harbin Shipbuilding Engineering Institute and then in 1994 to Harbin Engineering University.</p>\r\n<p class=\"vsbcontent_start\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; text-indent: 2em; text-align: justify; font-size: 14pt; color: #222222; line-height: 33.6px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"vsbcontent_start\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; text-indent: 2em; text-align: justify; font-size: 14pt; color: #222222; line-height: 33.6px;\">HEU consists of 20 colleges, 4 teaching departments (divisions and centers), more than 40 scientific research institutions and more than 150 scientific research and teaching laboratories. There are 6 national science innovative personnel bases, 1 national electrical and electronic teaching base, 7 provincial experimental teaching demonstration centers, and 1 national college students\' cultural quality education base.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.4rem; padding: 0px; word-break: break-word; text-align: justify; font-size: 0.2rem; color: #222222; line-height: 0.4rem;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Harbin Engineering University', 'harbin-engineering-university', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/50_1687085642.jpg', '2023-05-23 21:41:39', '2023-06-18 20:54:02', NULL, 1),
(51, 3, '<h3 class=\"tit\" style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 24px; color: #242424; line-height: 1.13em; font-weight: 400; overflow: hidden; font-family: MyriadProLight, MyriadPro, 微软雅黑, \'Microsoft Yahei\'; background-color: #f6f6f6;\">Founded in 1920, Harbin Institute of Technology has developed into an open, multidisciplinary, research-oriented,leading national university.</h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; color: #545454; font-family: MyriadProLight, MyriadPro, 微软雅黑, \'Microsoft Yahei\'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #f6f6f6; text-align: justify;\">Presently HIT is a member of China&rsquo;s top nine University Union (C9). It is a National Key University with science and engineering as its core and has developed with management, liberal arts, economy, lawand other disciplines. Renowned as &ldquo;the cradle of engineers,&rdquo; the university has many firsts. HIT established the first School of Astronautics in China. It was the first Chinese university to independently develop and enter small satellites (smallsats and microsats) into the moon&rsquo;s orbit. HIT was also the first to achieve satellite ground laser communication link communications. Additionally, HIT developed the first computer to play chess and talk with people and it is the first university to produce arc- and spot welding robots. HIT was the first university to reveal the virulent factor of the HIV virus. It was also the first university to achieve a major breakthrough in supporting structure development for the largest radio telescopes. The first human&ndash;machine in orbit maintenance experiments on a space operator was also developed by HIT.<br style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\" /><br style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; color: #545454; font-family: MyriadProLight, MyriadPro, 微软雅黑, \'Microsoft Yahei\'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #f6f6f6; text-align: justify;\">At HIT, there are 23 schools, 86 undergraduate programs, 9 National Key Disciplines, 7 National Key Labs, and 39 members of the prestigious Chinese Academy of Sciences and Chinese Academy of Engineering. Eleven disciplines of HIT are ranked among the top 1% on the Essential Science Indicators (ESI) lists. The material science and computer science of HIT in particular are ranked among the top 1&permil;, and engineering discipline ranked among the top 1‱. In 2020, HIT ranked 6th on the list of the best global universities for engineering announced by the U.S. News &amp; World Report.<br style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\" /><br style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"outline: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; color: #545454; font-family: MyriadProLight, MyriadPro, 微软雅黑, \'Microsoft Yahei\'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #f6f6f6; text-align: justify;\">Since its beginning, HIT has always had a strong international environment. Now HIT has signed academic cooperation agreements with 278 universities in 39 countries. These collaborations include student and faculty exchange programs, joint academic conferences, and scientific research cooperation. Together with Weihai campus and Shenzhen campus, HIT forms the pattern of &ldquo;One University, Three Campuses.&rdquo; HIT is steadily moving towards the goal of becoming a world-class university.</p>', 'Harbin Institute of Technology', 'harbin-institute-of-technology', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/51_1687080765.jpg', '2023-05-23 21:47:15', '2023-06-18 19:32:45', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `post_author`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `status`) VALUES
(52, 3, '<div class=\"subListTitle\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 36px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">\r\n<h2 class=\"fs30\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-size: 30px; position: relative; line-height: 1; font-weight: normal;\">General information</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"share\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 40px 0px 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; width: 70px; background: #f5f5f5; position: absolute; right: 0px; top: 92px;\">\r\n<div class=\"share_btn\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-size: 18px; transform: rotate(90deg);\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"bdsharebuttonbox\" style=\"margin: 25px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"articlePage\" style=\"margin: 0px 110px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">\r\n<div class=\"article\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 70px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; line-height: 2; color: #666666; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">China University of Petroleum-Beijing (CUP), founded in 1953, is a national key university directly affiliated to China&rsquo;s Ministry of Education. Its main campus lies at the southern foothill ofJundu Mountain in Beijing and the Karamay campus is located in Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region. With a distinctive characteristic in petroleum, CUP mainly focuses on engineering disciplines while having a coordinated development in multi-disciplines. In 1997, CUP became a member of China&rsquo;s first Project 211 universities and was nominated as one of the universities to construct National Innovative Platform for Advantageous Disciplines in 2006. In 2017, CUP was selected to participate in the \"Double First-Class\" Initiative, starting a new journey to build itself into a world-class university with Chinese characteristics.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">Disciplines</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">CUP is in a leading position in the petroleum and petrochemical disciplines in China. According to the ESI statistics by May 2020, CUP ranked within top 1% in ESI in the world for 5 disciplines: Chemistry, Engineering, Material Science, Geosciences and Computer Science, with the Engineering discipline getting into top 1&permil; in ESI globally. Based on the petroleum industrial structure, CUPhas established a discipline structure featuring: preponderantdisciplines of Oil &amp; Gas Engineering, Geological Resources andGeological Engineering, supporting disciplines of Chemistry,Material Science and Engineering, and newly emerging interdisciplinaryof Unconventional Oil &amp; Gas, New Energy andOffshore Oil &amp; Gas Engineering.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">Students</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">CUP is known as the &ldquo;Cradle of Petroleum Talents&rdquo; for cultivatingnearly 200,000 excellent professional talents since its founding. There are over 16,000 students studying at CUP, including 8,074 full-time undergraduates, 5,945 master students, 1,543 PhD students and 702 international students. Graduates from CUPenjoy great favour among society and employers, contributingto a high employment rate for years.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">Faculty</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Guided by the principle of &ldquo;Talents are the Primary Resources&rdquo;,CUP insists on implementing the development strategy of &ldquo;TalentsPowering the University&rdquo; and has built a highly competent faculty.Currently, there are 1,499 staff members, including 268 professors and 389 associate professors, 341 academic PhD supervisors and 133 PhD supervisors of engineering. Among them are 3 academiciansof the Chinese Academy of Sciences (CAS), 2 academicians ofthe Chinese Academy of Engineering (CAE). CUP promoted91 excellent researchers and professors, 9 innovation teams and 3 teaching teams that have been conferred honorary titles or funded at the national level and 6 teaching teams at the provincial level.Itwon 2second prizes in the 2018 National Teaching Achievement Award (High Education) from the Ministry of Education. CUP makes inclusive talent introduction channels and tailors diverse talent development plans to impel the growth of young teachers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">Research</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">CUPvalues scientific research adhering to the principle of &ldquo;undertaking major projects, establishing large platforms, organizing strong teams, making important achievements and contributions in research&rdquo;. Ithas 2 state key laboratories, 9 national research innovationsub-platforms, 23 research innovation platforms at provincial andministerial level and 18 key lab branches of China National PetroleumCorporation (CNPC). It has dominatedthe domestic leading position in several researching areas with an outstanding advantage in the disciplines of petroleum and petrochemistry.It has achieved rapid development in the fields of unconventional oil and gas, new energy and other emerging issues. Since the implementation of China&rsquo;s 13th Five-Year Plan period(2016-2020), CUP has undertaken 1467 national researchprojects, winning 13 National Science and Technology Awards with 5 for which CUP is the major participant. It has been awarded 283 prizes of Science and Technology awards at provincial andministerial level and for the non-governmental sector with 173 for which CUP is the major participant. It ranked 10th in2014 and 2015 and 7th in 2017 among all the universities in China forthe number of national prizes it has won for general projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">Philosophy</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">CUP insists on the development philosophy of combining government, industry, education and research. The Ministry of Education and China&rsquo;s 5 top petroleum enterprises signed the co-construction agreement on developing CUP in October 2013. Till now,CUP has reachedcomprehensive cooperation agreements with 144 entitiesincluding domesticgovernments, enterprises and public institutions. It has explored a new talent training model taking advantage of the resources from enterprises and the university: 76 petroleum and petrochemical enterprises have launched scholarships in CUP and 13 have built auditoriums with distinctive features of the enterprises. Also, it jointly enrollspost doctors with 40 enterprise postdoctoral research stations. Moreover, it has established postgraduate workstations and joint training bases with 202 petroleum and petrochemical enterprises, set up student internship bases with 103 enterprises andstudent social practice bases with 69 petroleum and petrochemical enterprises. CUP actively pursues the innovation of talent training mechanism to combine resources from government, industry and university: It has jointly created Karamay Institute of Engineers with Karamay City and established Beijing Institute of Engineers with the research institutes ofChina&rsquo;s 3 major oil companiesin Beijing, focusing on the implementation of Undergraduate Excellence Programand the training of professional degree graduates, taking new steps in the field of higher engineering education.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">Internationalization</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">CUP attaches great importance to international exchangesand cooperation. Through the strategy of Internationalization, ithas been promoting international exchanges and cooperation andincreasing its global influence in higher education. It has maintained a large network of academic and industrial relationships with over 170 universities and enterprises abroad. And it has set up 13 international joint instituteswith world-famous universities and enterprises; moreover,it has established a Confucius Institute in cooperation withSan Francisco University in Quito, Ecuador. In 2018, CUP initiated Worldwide Energy University Network (WEUN) which has 31 member universities from 17 countries such as China, the USA, the UK, Canada, Germany, France, etc. Responding to the Belt and Road Initiative actively, it has established cooperative links with over 60 universities and institutions from countries alongthe Belt and Road.It was selected to join the Belt and Road scholarship programof Beijing for international students and the Belt and Roadnational talent training base program of Beijing in 2017. It was approved to joinChinese Government Scholarship-Silk Road Scholarship Program in the same year andthe Chinese Government Scholarship-China-Africa Friendship Programand China-Africa Friendship General Scholar Programin 2019.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Adhering to the tradition of petroleum industry culture, a campus atmosphere with distinctive petroleum characteristics has been formed. Encouraged by the spirit of &ldquo;being diligent, practical, dedicated, and pioneering&rdquo; and inspired by the motto of &ldquo;accumulating profound knowledge and solving practical problems&rdquo;, the students lucubrate in the way of &ldquo;diligence, rigour, truth-seeking and innovation&rdquo; and the teachers dedicate to the cause of education upholding the belief of &ldquo;teaching knowledge and fostering virtue&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Standing at a new historical starting point, CUP will insistently strive to build itself into a &ldquo;world-class&rdquo; research university in petroleum and petrochemical sciences disciplines.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased; font-family: \'Roboto Condensed\', arial, \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimSun, SimHei, \'STHeiti Light\', STHeiti, \'Lucida Grande\', Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">School Rankings</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: subpixel-antialiased;\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'China University of Petroleum', 'china-university-of-petroleum', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'university', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/posts/52_1687080333.jpg', '2023-05-23 21:51:07', '2023-06-18 19:25:33', NULL, 1),
(53, 3, '<div class=\"n_tit cleafix\" style=\"width: 924px; border-bottom: 1px solid #00a44e; height: 49px; line-height: 49px; color: #787878; font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><img style=\"border: 0px; margin: 18px 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-width: 0px; vertical-align: top; float: left;\" src=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/images/ico10.png\" /><a style=\"color: #787878; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in 0s;\" href=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/index.htm\">中心首页</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; font-family: consolas; padding: 0px 6px; color: #666666 !important;\">&gt;</span>&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #787878; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in 0s;\" href=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/lxfw/zsjz.htm\">留学福外</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; font-family: consolas; padding: 0px 6px; color: #666666 !important;\">&gt;</span>&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #787878; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in 0s;\" href=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/lxfw/zsjz.htm\">招生简章</a></div>\r\n<ul class=\"n_listxx1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; width: 924px; min-height: 500px; color: #575757; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">\r\n<li id=\"line_u7_0\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; list-style-type: none; width: 924px; border-color: initial initial #ededed initial;\">\r\n<h2 class=\"cleafix\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a style=\"color: #636363; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in 0s; font-size: 16px; float: left;\" title=\"福州外语外贸学院2023年国际学生招生简章\" href=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/info/1094/2392.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">福州外语外贸学院2023年国际学生招生简章</a><span class=\"time\" style=\"color: #a2a2a2; padding-left: 15px; background-image: url(\'../images/ico11.png\'); background-position: left center; background-size: initial; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; float: right;\">2023-03-06</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 4px 0px 0px; list-style-type: none; color: #9b9b9b; line-height: 28px; text-indent: 2em;\">福州外语外贸学院是经教育部批准设立的全日制普通本科学校，是全国非营利性民办高等学校联盟发起单位、副主席单位和中国民办教育协会高等教育专业委员会常务副理事长单位、硕士研究生联合培养单位。学校前身为始创于2004年的福州外语外贸职业技术学院，2011年经国家教育部批准升格为普通本科高校，2018年通过教育部普通高等学校本科教学工作合格评估。在福建省教育评估研究中心发布的《2018福建省普通高校发展潜力监测报告》中...[<a style=\"color: #00a44e; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in 0s;\" href=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/info/1094/2392.htm\">详细</a>]</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li id=\"line_u7_1\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; list-style-type: none; width: 924px; border-color: initial initial #ededed initial;\">\r\n<h2 class=\"cleafix\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a style=\"color: #636363; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in 0s; font-size: 16px; float: left;\" title=\"Fuzhou University of International Studies and Trade 2023 Admission Guide for International Students\" href=\"http://www.fzfu.com/gjzx/info/1094/2391.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fuzhou University of International Studies and Trade 2023 Admission Guide for International Students</a><span class=\"time\" style=\"color: #a2a2a2; padding-left: 15px; background-image: url(\'../images/